 "how_to_read_the_headline": "n_clusters_free is the ceiling on how many independent units a cluster-disjoint Set B could hold, not the size of Set B. Each unit still needs an apo form, a holo form and a cryptic pocket that survives the same labelling rule Set A used, and every one of those only removes candidates",
